SUMMARY:Splitsville
DTSTART:20250907T181500Z
DTEND:20250907T201500Z
DTSTAMP:20250907T181500Z
UID:IhO1EHUocP
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 100 mins (1h40m)\n\nWhen his wife asks for a divorce
 \, a man runs to his friends for support\, only to learn that the secret t
 o their happiness is an open marriage. Intro and Q&A with filmmakers Micha
 el Angelo Covino and Kyle Marvin at the 7:00pm screening on August 29.\n\n
 https://www.siff.net/cinema/in-theaters/splitsville
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Uptown House 2\, 511 Queen Anne Avenue North
END:VEVENT
