DTEND:20250911T010500Z
DTSTAMP:20250910T231500Z
UID:r6B2NLAN8M
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 90 mins (1h30m)\n\nShe only has two desires\, and on
 e of them is justice. Honey O’Donahue\, a small-town private investigato
 r\, delves into a series of strange deaths tied to a mysterious church in 
 this comic noir.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/cinema/in-theaters/honey-dont
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Uptown House 2\, 511 Queen Anne Avenue North
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:The Roses
DTSTART:20250911T234500Z
DTEND:20250912T015000Z
DTSTAMP:20250911T234500Z
UID:wknSMkEZZS
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 105 mins (1h45m)\n\nBenedict Cumberbatch and Olivia 
 Colman play a picture-perfect married couple who descend into a bitter cat
 -and-dog divorce battle in this reimagining of The War of the Roses. Conta
 ins several sequences with flashing lights that may affect those who are s
 usceptible to photosensitive epilepsy or have other photosensitivities.\n\
 nhttps://www.siff.net/cinema/in-theaters/the-roses
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Uptown House 2\, 511 Queen Anne Avenue North
END:VEVENT
